            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTICE:-- The public are hereby notified that our messongers having refused work delay can be expected in the delivery of telegrams. To accelerate delivery the public are kindly requested to apply at our office for any telegrams they may be expecting. E.A.LRCGATT, Superintendent, The Eastern Extension Australia and China Telegraph Co., Ltd.",
