        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTICE - HONGKONG STOCK EXCHANGE: -- By permission of His Excellency the Governor, the Hongkong Stock Exchange postponed their Settlement for Juno 25rd, to Tuesday, July 7th, 1925. For the Hongkong Stock Exchange, H. BIRKETT, Chairman. - Hongkong, Juno 22, 1925.",
