        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTICE: -- All Chinese British subjects are recoosted to report themselves at the City Hall, between the hours of 10 a.m. and 6 p.m. on any day before Saturday, the 27th instant. S.W.T'S0, Assistant Controller of Labour, Hongkong, 25th June, 1925.",
