        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTICE:--- Notice is hereby given that the Hongkong Stock Exchange is closed from this date and the June Settlement has been postponed until Tuesday, July 7th, 1925. By Order of the Committee,\nA. NISSIM, Secretary, Hongkong, June 22, 1925.",
