        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTICE: -- The \"CHINA MAIL\" strike issues having excited much comment, the public will be interested to learn that the machine employed is the famous Gostotnor for which Messrs. Lano, Crawford, Ltd. are the Hongkong Agents.\nSHAMEEN SHOOTING: -- (Router's Service),\nCanton, June 25.- Replying to the protott of the\nCivil Governor of Canton with regard to the shooting\nof June 23, the British Consul General has omphatically repudiated the Governor's allegation that foreign officials at Carton were responsible for the affair and has requested the Governor to take very complete measures to safeguard the lives of Britons at Canton.",
