        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SHANGHAI STUDENT PLOT (Router) Shanghai, June 25:--- The Police yesterday obtained information of a widespread student plot to hire motor-cars and dash round the International Settlement bombing and shooting. The Police ordered garages not to hire cars except to well-known customers. The special constables were mobilised and posted at strategic points. Young Chinese were searched for arms and other precautions were taken. The shipping situation is becoming worse. British and Japanese ocean-going ships are avoiding Shanghai.",
            "block_bbox": [
