        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "FRANCE PROTESTS (Router) Peking, Juno 25:--\nThe Fronch Minister has handed the Chinosé Foreign\nMinistor a note protesting against the killing of\na French merchant at Canton on Tuesday and roserving the right to claim reparation. Twenty thousand students, workman and merchants paraded the streets carrying banners, some of which were inscribed \"Declare war against England!\" Chinese troops and police guarded foreign premises, also the entrancos to the Logation quarter, but there was no sign of any disturbances.",
